product_description:
The Johannes family have recently purchased the Onikul Vineyard and renamed it the JohannesBurg Vineyard. This is a sentimental name as the family are of German heritage who were living in South Africa and recently moved to the Hunter Valley, Australia.
 
Johannes - Family Name;
Burg - German for fortress/castle;
Johannesburg - South African city;
JohannesBurg = Family Fortress.
 
This small batch of Semillon is displaying grassy herbaceous aromas along with juicy sweet limes and crunchy green apples on the nose and palate which are indicative of this vineyard. Enjoyable now but those that can keep it for 5-7 years are in for a real treat!
 
Limited Release of 190 Dozen.
